; Weapon class of a section, first match wins, cached per section:
;  1. [ai_weapon_class_overrides];
;  2. no ammo_class: not a firearm (none);
;  3. slot in pistol_slots: pistol;
;  4. the first ammo_class entry by prefix family: none_ammo -> none, launcher_ammo -> launcher, shotgun_ammo ->
;     shotgun, smg_ammo (pistol calibres in a long-gun slot; the PM's 9x18 also feeds the Kiparis and the Bizon) -> smg;
;  5. automatic (fire_modes holds -1) with a magazine of mg_mag or more: mg (before the scope rule: the PKM shares
;     7.62x54 with the SVD);
;  6. a built-in or attached scope with scope_zoom_factor >= dmr_zoom and a magazine of dmr_max_mag or less (0 = any):
;     dmr - a scoped assault rifle stays a rifle and reaches farther by scoped_range_mult instead;
;  7. [ai_weapon_class_rifle_old]: rifle_old; else rifle.
[ai_weapon_class_rules]
