; [ai:sense] begin ai_light
; Light as a sense of stalkers. darkness runs from 0 (day) to 1 (night) with the brightest channel of the weather's
; ambient + hemi + sun colour between the two ambient values. A muzzle flash is seen by stalkers that face it within
; muzzle_range and have a line of sight: a muzzle_flash estimate of the shooter and, for flash_cue_ms, faster
; recognition of him. A lit torch speeds the recognition of its carrier by torch_rate x glow (glow = strength by the
; beam's angle to the viewer, side-on .. straight at him, x (1 - distance / torch_range)); a lamp that glows at least
; torch_notice is noticed by itself (a flashlight estimate of its carrier), and at night the spot its beam lights.
